<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Beacon raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Beacon raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown &amp; Sons said it raised its rating of Beacon Properties Corp on Wednesday to a buy rating from its prior rating of neutral.</p>
</text>
